  "_readme": "Institution name (as it appears verbatim in an ar5iv affiliation string) -> ISO country code. Hand-curated: fetch_affiliations_arxiv.py only gets institution NAMES from arXiv/ar5iv, not country codes the way OpenAlex's authors_detail does, so this fills that gap. Entries are added as real institution names show up in data/affiliations_arxiv.json -- verified via web search, not guessed, same 'no unverified claims' standard as the Scholar profile lookups (see DECISIONS.md).",
